{"4566780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ALFA: Antiterror", "steam_appid": 4566780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the commander of elite soldiers from the Russian special forces unit ALFA, you take charge in the fight against terrorism. Each of your men has his own skills and strengths, and every terrain and mission presents its own challenges and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy is always in greater numbers and on alert. Analyze the situation, develop a strategy, and eliminate the threat! No mission is the same, and there is no universal plan to accomplish your objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALFA Antiterror is based on real events and the experiences of former ALFA members. Authentic missions, as well as true-to-life environments, vehicles, and weapons, complete the realistic gameplay experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive story mode based on historical events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse missions in cities, forests, mountains, and deserts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artificial intelligence with realistic behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the camera mode, you can replay and closely observe the action</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the commander of elite soldiers from the Russian special forces unit ALFA, you take charge in the fight against terrorism. Each of your men has his own skills and strengths, and every terrain and mission presents its own challenges and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy is always in greater numbers and on alert. Analyze the situation, develop a strategy, and eliminate the threat! No mission is the same, and there is no universal plan to accomplish your objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALFA Antiterror is based on real events and the experie